      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Keonho_PH/status/2016183062292521311",
      "text": "The Birthday Polls for #KEONHO have officially ended!  In just one month, we won 4 votings, fighting this battle hand in hand as one team.\n\nWe proudly placed 1st on UPICK, 2nd on Starvibe, 1st on Queeri, and most recently we secured a landslide victory on My1Pick.\nThank you to every coer who joined us in this one-month-long journey. We worked hard, supported one another, and achieved incredible results. We did very well—and we did it with grace and humility.\n\nNow, we shift our full focus to Keonho’s birthday project. Everyone, fasten your seatbelt coz we have prepared the grandest birthday for him, because he deserves nothing but the best. 🎉💙\n\n #건호 #CORTIS  #코르티스",
